              "Text": "_Cultivars used in cropping systems experiments_\n\n(wheat, Base/IniBase)\n\n\n# Wheat\n\nBeckom ~ Gauntlet\n\nBennett\n\nCoolah ~ Gregory\n\nIllabo \n\nKittyhawk\n\nMustang ~ Condo\n\nRaider ~ Lancer\n\nRockstar ~ Gregory/Bolac\n\nScepter\n\n",
              "Name": "Introduction",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.PMF.Cultivar, Models",
              "Command": [
                "// this is of Beckom with the updated parameter values",
                "",
                "[Phenology].CAMP.FLNparams.MinLN = 8",
                "[Phenology].CAMP.FLNparams.VrnLN = 1",
                "[Phenology].CAMP.FLNparams.PpLN = 1",
                "[Phenology].CAMP.FLNparams.VxPLN= -10",
                "[Phenology].HeadEmergenceLongDayBase.FixedValue = 70",
                "[Phenology].HeadEmergencePpSensitivity.FixedValue = 1"
